osition. No sliding or scale change, second woman, translucent face or body, pose dissolve, reset to the photograph, camera move, cut, fade, text or new background traffic. Soft neutral white light on skin and ivory gown, blue only in the set and trim; no pink or magenta wash, flash, flicker, waxy skin or CGI anatomy. Native speed and the full source-audio interval, no added voice, music or Foley.",
